    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "THE TEST",
      "narration_text": "Then I tested one properly. I gave HyperFrames the finished footage and narration from Suno part one, and asked for captions that light up word by word, and a new intro. It came back with a four-minute cut: ninety-four caption lines, and none of them overlapping.",
