    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "WHAT IT SHOWED",
      "narration_text": "So here's what the test showed. The agent was good at packaging footage that already exists: captions, titles, an intro. It didn't add new teaching visuals; those still came from our own scenes. It didn't reach our four K standard. And OpenReel and DaVinci Resolve haven't had a hands-on test yet.",
