    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "THE GUIDE",
      "narration_text": "The second piece is the setup guide, and it's still in progress. It covers everything a new fellow needs before they can make anything. Discord comes first, because everything else hangs off it. Suno, which you sign into with Discord. Midjourney, through the Humanitarians AI Discord. And Canva. For each one: how to get access to the account, and how to use the tool.",
